{"articleNo":"1368","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1368&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"신입 사원 모집 안내_성현C&T","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.08.31","hit":"9806","attachments":[{"name":"붙임 1. 이력서,자기소개서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1368&attachNo=70159"},{"name":"붙임 2. 주간보고서,결과보고서(학생작성).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1368&attachNo=70160"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">『그린에너지시스템인재양성센터』</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">신입 사원 모집 안내_성현C&amp;T</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">성현C&amp;T</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">에서는 신입 사원을 모집하고 있사오니 관심있는 졸업생들은 신청해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -70pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -78.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">업 체 명</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 성현C&amp;T</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -78.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">주생산품</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 디지털 도어록, 전기자전거</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -83.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 83.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">근 무 지</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 경상북도 구미시 공단동 267 비즈니스센터 309호</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -78.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">지원자격</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 본교 센터 참여전공(기계공학부, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">전자공학부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">, 정보나노소재공학전공, 재료공학전공, 금속공학전공, 고분자공학전공, 산업시스템공학전공, 응용화학전공, 환경공학전공) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">미취업 졸업생</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 78.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -70pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">모집인원</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -70pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">근무부서</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">인원수</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">전공</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">담당업무</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">개발부</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">전자공학부</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"159\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">연구개발</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -70pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -83.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 83.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">급&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 여</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 수습기간 6개월(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">월 200만원 정도</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">) 후 정규직 전환(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">정규직 전환시 연봉 2400만원 이상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -70pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">근무시간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 기업체 근무시간 준수, 주 5일 근무</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -70pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">8. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">특이사항</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 수습기간 중 4대보험 개인부담금 지원, 식사 제공</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -70pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">9. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수습기간 중 제출서류</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(붙임2.참조) : 주간보고서(매주1부),결과보고서(1부) 작성 및 제출</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -70pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 70pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">10. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">결과통보 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">: 개별통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청기간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 채용완료시 까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청서류</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(붙임1.참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 이력서, 자기소개서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 졸업증명서, 성적증명서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 어학성적(해당자한함), 자격증 사본(해당자한함) 등</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">신청방법</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 신청서류를 이메일, 팩스, 우편으로 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 기타 문의사항은 아래의 연락처로 문의바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">주소 : [730-701] 경상북도 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교 공동실험실습관 401호</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">TEL. 054)478-7930 FAX. 054)478-7934 E-mail: </span><a href=\"mailto:tomsy@kumoh.ac.kr\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">tomsy@kumoh.ac.kr</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
